<title>USA: Chart of computer sales.</title>
<headline>Chart of computer sales.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a chart of shipments in 1996, 1995 and 1996 market share for the top five computer makers. as reported by research firm Dataquest:</p>
<p>Company		   1996	    1995	    Mkt. Share</p>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp. 7.128 million 6.016 million 10.1 percent International</p>
<p>Business Machines     6.09  million 4.761 million  8.6 percent</p>
<p>Packard Bell NEC Inc. 4.33  million 4.555 million  6.1 percent Apple Computer Inc.   3.696 million 4.735 million  5.2 percent</p>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co.   2.914 million 1.92  million  4.1 percent</p>
</text>
